('1083889835355389576', '15 Effortlessly Cool Boho Travel Outfits That Look Incredible in Every Country You Visit', 'Boho travel style has a specific quality that makes it perfect for exploring the world — it photographs beautifully against every backdrop from Moroccan riads and Balinese temples to Tuscan vineyards and Greek island cliffs, it layers naturally for temperature changes, and it carries an effortless confidence that feels genuinely at home everywhere. These effortlessly cool boho travel outfits capture all of that with fifteen looks that pack light, travel well, and look like you dressed with intention whether you spent two minutes or twenty. Flowy tiered maxi skirts with simple fitted tops and sandals that work equally well wandering a spice market in Marrakech or a morning coffee in a Parisian courtyard.', 'https://cruiseshipmania.com/15-boho-airport-outfit-ideas/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1083889835355389576', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/08/4d/d1/084dd146e335ac43ddb55db5f48ea24e.png', '', '', '', 1, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Airport Outfits', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruiseshipmania/airport-outfits/', '', '', '', 'public', '', 'Cruise Tips | Travel Outfits | Women Fashion', 'cruiseshipmania', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruise