('1083889835355658283', '15 Chic Plus Size Cruise Outfits for Beach Days | Flattering & Fabulous', 'Stylish plus size cruise outfits for beach days that are comfortable, flattering, and vacation-ready! From breezy cover-ups to bold swimsuit styles, these looks are perfect for shore excursions, pool days, and tropical ports. Save this pin for plus size summer outfit ideas and cruise fashion inspiration you\'ll actually love.', 'https://cruiseshipmania.com/15-plus-size-beach-cruise-outfits/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1083889835355658283', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/74/01/b3/7401b3db04d836b02c518172bab7b566.png', '', '', '', 2, 0, '0', 1, 0, 0, 0, 'Beach Outfits', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruiseshipmania/beach-outfits/', '', '', '', 'public', '', 'Cruise Tips | Travel Outfits | Women Fashion', 'cruiseshipmania', 'https://www.pinterest.com/cruiseshipmania', '', '', 1679, '', '', '', '', '', '2026-06-11T04:01:55.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:12:12.004Z', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
