('1105141196091849812', 'Ocean Breeze Two-Piece Beach Set', 'This effortlessly chic two-piece ensemble captures the serene beauty of the sea with its soft blue, watercolor-inspired print. The cropped top features a flattering sweetheart neckline with gentle ruching at the center, complemented by off-shoulder sheer sleeves that flow gracefully with every movement.\nPaired with a matching high-slit wrap skirt, the design adds a touch of allure while maintaining an airy, relaxed vibe. The skirt is elegantly tied at the waist with a soft knot detail, allowing adjustable comfort and a flattering fit.\nLightweight and breezy, this outfit is perfect for beach getaways, tropical vacations, or sunset strolls by the shore. Styled with a wide-brim straw hat and delicate accessories, it creates a dreamy, coastal-inspired look that feels both feminine ,refreshing', 'https://payhip.com/b/uqd4j', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1105141196091849812', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/63/a6/3e/63a63e12469a78efe489723048dc6e75.jpg', '', '', '', 251, 0, '24', 244, 0, 0, 32, 'Pins by you', 'https://www.pinterest.com/hdfitdesigns/_quick_creates/', '', '', '', 'public', '', 'hdfitdesigns', 'hdfitdesigns', 'https://www.pinterest.com/hdfitdesigns', '', '', 1, '', '', '', '',