('1134977543658247366', '15 Cute Boho Summer Outfit Ideas for 2026 Fashion', 'Discover cute boho summer outfit ideas 2026 featuring trendy boho outfits, lightweight layers, embroidered tops, maxi dresses, and casual chic styling. These stylish summer outfits are perfect for June outfits, July outfits, travel days, weekend plans, beach trips, and effortless warm-weather fashion.', 'https://theoutfititinerary.com/15-boho-summer-outfits/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1134977543658247366', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/fb/30/da/fb30daa4b4263b1d5513de70062fc3e7.png', '', '', '', 2, 0, '0', 1, 0, 0, 0, 'Summer Outfits', 'https://www.pinterest.com/theoutfititineraryy/summer-outfits/', '', '', '', 'public', '', 'The Outfit Itinerary', 'theoutfititineraryy', 'https://www.pinterest.com/theoutfititineraryy', '', '', 17, '', '', '', '', '', '2026-05-28T18:00:47.000Z', '2026-06-23T17:23:01.177Z', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('1134977543659103917', '15 Gorgeous Beach Outfit Ideas for Every Type of Beach Day This Summer', 'Not all beach days are created equal — and these 15 gorgeous beach outfit ideas cover every single type! Whether you\'re lounging on a quiet Caribbean cruise port beach, hitting a lively Mediterranean beach club, spending a full resort pool day, or exploring a rocky coastal town, there\'s a perfect outfit here for every scenario. From effortlessly chic linen cover-up sets and breezy sundresses that double as beach-to-lunch outfits, to bold printed swimsuit looks and elegant maxi wraps that photograph beautifully in every golden hour light — this collection is your ultimate summer beach style guide. Every look is packable, flattering, and endlessly versatile across every beach destination on earth. Save this pin and dress for the most beautiful beach days of your life!', 'https://theoutfititinerary.com/15-summer-beach-outfit-ideas/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1134977543659103917', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.png', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/f4/cb/7a/f4cb7a92e925d129caf58ff6d125196c.png', '', '', '', 1, 0, '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Beach Outfit Ideas', 'https://www.pinterest.com/theoutfititineraryy/beach-outfit-ideas/', '', '', '', 'public', '', 'The Outfit Itinerary', 'theoutfititine