('1138495980824193729', 'Gesunde Burger Bowl', 'The Gesunde Burger Bowl addresses the need for a quick and satisfying meal option that combines the flavors of a classic cheeseburger into a wholesome bowl. Made with tender ground beef and rich cheddar cheese, this recipe offers a flexible solution for weeknight dinners, meal prep, or family gatherings. It effortlessly utilizes ingredients like crisp Romaine lettuce and flavorful pickles, ensuring it remains a comforting choice with potential for leftovers. This dish serves as an easy way to...', 'https://americanhomeplates.com/healthy-burger-bowl/', 'https://www.pinterest.com/pin/1138495980824193729', 'https://i.pinimg.com/originals/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg', '60x60: https://i.pinimg.com/60x60/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n136x136: https://i.pinimg.com/136x136/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n170x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n236x: https://i.pinimg.com/236x/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n474x: https://i.pinimg.com/474x/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n564x: https://i.pinimg.com/564x/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n736x: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\n600x315: https://i.pinimg.com/600x315/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg\norig: https://i.pinimg.com/originals/27/d1/f8/27d1f800f97b17fa4be11be4b884512e.jpg', '', '', '', 149, 0, '1', 64, 0, 0, 14, 'High Protein Recipes', 'https://www.pinterest.com/christiniarecipes/high-protein-recipes/', '', '', '', 'public', '', 'Purely Homemade Eats Recipes | Comfort Meals', 'christiniarecipes', 'https://www.pinterest.com/christiniarecipes', '', '', 2, '', '', '', '', '', '2026-05-24T07:03:52.000Z', '2026-06-23T16:43:16.710Z', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', ''