('1109222583261558096', 'Buttery Miso Glazed Black Cod', 'This buttery miso glazed black cod is a rich and flavorful seafood recipe inspired by popular Japanese restaurant dishes. Tender black cod is coated in a savory sweet miso glaze that caramelizes beautifully while baking. Pinterest searches for miso cod recipes, Asian-inspired dinners, gourmet seafood meals, and elegant date night recipes continue to trend, making this recipe ideal for foodie audiences. The silky texture and umami-packed flavor create a restaurant-quality meal right at home. Save this impressive seafood dinner recipe for special occasions or cozy nights in. #blackcod #misorecipe #seafoodrecipes #japanesefood #dinnerideas', 'https://flavli.com/buttery-miso-glazed-black-cod', '', '', '', '', '', '', 129, 0, '{\'1\': 1}', 71, 1, 0, 4, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 'Sat, 09 May 2026 04:05:24 +0000', '', '', '[]', '', '', '{\'aggregated_stats\': {\'done\': 0, \'saves\': 129}, \'comment_count\': 1, \'creator_analytics\': None, \'did_it_data\': {\'details_count\': 0, \'images_count\': 0, \'rating\': -1, \'recommend_scores\': [{\'count\': 0, \'score\': 1}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0.5}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0}], \'recommended_count\': 0, \'responses_count\': 0, \'tags\': [], \'type\': \'aggregateddiditdata\', \'user_count\': 0, \'videos_count\': 0}, \'id\': \'3486508956964623744\', \'is_shop_the_look\': False, \'is_stela\': False}', '[]', 'Miso glazed black cod fillet with glossy sauce and sesame garnish on a plate', '', '', '', '', '{\'ads_only_profile_site\': None, \'blocked_by_me\': False, \'domain_url\': \'flavli.com\', \'domain_verified\': False, \'explicitly_followed_by_me\': False, \'first_name\': \'Flavli | Home Cooking & Food Ideas\', \'followed_by_me\': False, \'follower_count\': 34, \'full_name\': \'Flavli | Home Cooking & Food Ideas\', \'id\': \'1109222720631388924\', \'image_medium_url\': \'https://i.pinimg.com/75x75_RS/48/a4/d0/48a4d0bc1a90b