('1112670651692464829', 'Grilled Chipotle Chicken Sandwich', 'If you’re craving a delicious sandwich with tons of flavor, this chipotle chicken sandwich recipe is just what you need. Juicy, marinated chicken thighs grilled to perfection and paired with toasted brioche buns, fresh tomato slices, lettuce, and pepper jack cheese. Make this meal and you’ll want to make it again and again. And the best part? It’s an easy recipe that takes only 25 minutes to make and costs just $25 for a family of four.', 'https://lolajayyum.com/grilled-chipotle-chicken-sandwich/', '', '', '', '', '', '', 1320, 0, '{\'1\': 14}', 125, 0, 0, 15, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 'Sun, 09 Feb 2025 02:02:56 +0000', '', '', '[]', '', '', '{\'aggregated_stats\': {\'done\': 0, \'saves\': 1320}, \'comment_count\': 0, \'creator_analytics\': None, \'did_it_data\': {\'details_count\': 0, \'images_count\': 0, \'rating\': -1, \'recommend_scores\': [{\'count\': 0, \'score\': 1}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0.5}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0}], \'recommended_count\': 0, \'responses_count\': 0, \'tags\': [], \'type\': \'aggregateddiditdata\', \'user_count\': 0, \'videos_count\': 0}, \'id\': \'5412941058646534289\', \'is_shop_the_look\': False, \'is_stela\': False}', '[]', '', '', '', '', '', '{\'ads_only_profile_site\': None, \'blocked_by_me\': False, \'domain_url\': \'lolajayyum.com\', \'domain_verified\': True, \'explicitly_followed_by_me\': False, \'first_name\': \'Lola | Easy Mediterranean Recipes + Home Cooking\', \'followed_by_me\': False, \'follower_count\': 110, \'full_name\': \'Lola | Easy Mediterranean Recipes + Home Cooking\', \'id\': \'1112670789095855390\', \'image_medium_url\': \'https://i.pinimg.com/75x75_RS/d5/a9/07/d5a90738afe56cd06fbe785b4fa5974b.jpg\', \'image_small_url\': \'https://i.pinimg.com/30x30_RS/d5/a9/07/d5a90738afe56cd06fbe785b4fa5974b.jpg\', \'indexed\': True, \'instagram_data\': None, \'is_ads_only_profile\': False, \'is_default_image\': Fa