('786933734932887845', 'Deliciously Sauted Zucchini and Mushrooms Recipe for a Healthy and Flavorful Side Dish', 'Savor the perfect blend of tender zucchini and earthy mushrooms sauted to golden perfection. This healthy side dish is quick to make, bursting with flavor, and pairs beautifully with any meal. Whether you\'re looking to add more veggies to your plate or need a simple, nutritious recipe, this sauted zucchini and mushrooms dish is a delicious choice that\'s both satisfying and easy to customize.', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1814490530/mushroom-salad-recipe-pdf-cups-grams-o?7949264125=', '', '', '', '', '', '', 36, 0, '{\'1\': 2}', 35, 0, 0, 2, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 'Thu, 04 Dec 2025 05:31:35 +0000', '', '', '[]', '', '', '{\'aggregated_stats\': {\'done\': 0, \'saves\': 36}, \'comment_count\': 0, \'creator_analytics\': None, \'did_it_data\': {\'details_count\': 0, \'images_count\': 0, \'rating\': -1, \'recommend_scores\': [{\'count\': 0, \'score\': 1}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0.5}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0}], \'recommended_count\': 0, \'responses_count\': 0, \'tags\': [], \'type\': \'aggregateddiditdata\', \'user_count\': 0, \'videos_count\': 0}, \'id\': \'3033129249059268288\', \'is_shop_the_look\': False, \'is_stela\': False}', '[]', 'Savor the perfect blend of tender zucchini and earthy mushrooms sauted to golden perfection. This healthy side dish is quick to make, bursting with flavor, and pairs beautifully with any meal. Whether you\'re looking to add more veggies to your plate or need a simple, nutritious recipe, this sauted zucchini and mushrooms dish is a delicious choice that\'s both satisfying and easy to customize.', '', '', '', '', '{\'ads_only_profile_site\': None, \'blocked_by_me\': False, \'domain_url\': None, \'domain_verified\': False, \'explicitly_followed_by_me\': False, \'first_name\': \'Kfserhat\', \'followed_by_me\': False, \'follower_count\': 23, \'full_name\': \'Kfserhat\', \'i