('925841635911006503', 'Fluffy Baked Egg & Sausage Breakfast Pan | Easy Turkish Breakfast Recipe 🍳', 'A soft, delicious Turkish-style breakfast pan made with eggs, milk, and flour — loaded with colorful bell peppers, sausage (sucuk), and melted cheese. Perfect for busy mornings or a family brunch! 🧡 Quick to prepare, easy to bake, and full of flavor!\n\nBake Time: 15 minutes at 190°C (375°F) on the lowest rack of the oven for an evenly baked, golden top and perfectly cooked bottom.\nPro Tip: Always use baking paper to prevent sticking and achieve the best texture.\n\n\n\nIngredients :\n\n2 cups milk\n\n2 eggs\n\n1 tsp salt\n\n1 cup + 1 tbsp flour\n\nToppings: sliced green and red bell peppers, grated cheese (kaşar), sliced sausage (sucuk)', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 21603, 0, '{\'1\': 2039}', 19001, 58, 0, 3369, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 'Wed, 29 Oct 2025 12:14:56 +0000', '', '', '[]', '', '', '{\'aggregated_stats\': {\'done\': 1, \'saves\': 21603}, \'comment_count\': 58, \'creator_analytics\': None, \'did_it_data\': {\'details_count\': 0, \'images_count\': 1, \'rating\': -1, \'recommend_scores\': [{\'count\': 0, \'score\': 1}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0.5}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0}], \'recommended_count\': 1, \'responses_count\': 0, \'tags\': [], \'type\': \'aggregateddiditdata\', \'user_count\': 1, \'videos_count\': 0}, \'id\': \'2929573577395572416\', \'is_shop_the_look\': False, \'is_stela\': False}', '[]', 'Fluffy Turkish baked egg and sausage breakfast pan with melted cheese, colorful bell peppers, and golden crust — easy oven-baked breakfast recipe, perfect for busy mornings or family brunch.', '', '', '', '', '{\'ads_only_profile_site\': None, \'blocked_by_me\': False, \'domain_url\': None, \'domain_verified\': False, \'explicitly_followed_by_me\': False, \'first_name\': \'Ab kitchen\', \'followed_by_me\': False, \'follower_count\': 870, \'full_name\': \'Ab kitchen\', \'id\': \'925841773304006822\', \'image