('980799625116780424', '🥜🍫 Peanut & Chocolate Bonbons – Creamy, Keto-Friendly & Freezer-Ready! By: @chiara.fiorani', '📊 Estimated Macros (per bonbon, est. – makes 5):\nCalories: ~60 | Fat: ~5 g | Protein: ~2.8 g | Net Carbs: ~1.5 g\n\nIngredients (Makes 5 bonbons):\n⅔ cup full-fat Greek yogurt (150 g)\n1 tbsp peanut butter (15 g)\n1 tbsp cocoa powder (8 g)\nKeto-friendly sweetener, to taste (I used sugar-free maple syrup, about 1–2 tsp / 5–10 ml)\nTopping:\nSugar-free dark chocolate, melted (about 1 oz / 30 g)\n\nInstructions:\nIn a bowl, combine the Greek yogurt, peanut butter, cocoa powder, and sweetener until smooth.\nSpoon or shape the mixture into bonbons and place them on a parchment-lined tray.\nFreeze for at least 4 hours, until fully firm.\nDip the frozen bonbons into the melted sugar-free dark chocolate.\nReturn to the freezer or fridge until the chocolate sets, then enjoy! 🫶🏼\n. #chocolatebonbons', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 6062, 0, '{\'1\': 247}', 3299, 17, 0, 102, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', '', 'Sat, 17 Jan 2026 12:28:51 +0000', '', '', '[]', '', '', '{\'aggregated_stats\': {\'done\': 1, \'saves\': 6062}, \'comment_count\': 17, \'creator_analytics\': None, \'did_it_data\': {\'details_count\': 0, \'images_count\': 1, \'rating\': -1, \'recommend_scores\': [{\'count\': 0, \'score\': 1}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0.5}, {\'count\': 0, \'score\': 0}], \'recommended_count\': 1, \'responses_count\': 0, \'tags\': [], \'type\': \'aggregateddiditdata\', \'user_count\': 1, \'videos_count\': 0}, \'id\': \'3161529850269788672\', \'is_shop_the_look\': False, \'is_stela\': False}', '[]', '', '', '', '', '', '', '📊 Estimated Macros (per bonbon, est. – makes 5):\nCalories: ~60 | Fat: ~5 g | Protein: ~2.8 g | Net Carbs: ~1.5 g\n\nIngredients (Makes 5 bonbons):\n⅔ cup full-fat Greek yogurt (150 g)\n1 tbsp peanut butter (15 g)\n1 tbsp cocoa powder (8 g)\nKeto-friendly sweetener, to taste (I used sugar-free maple syrup, about 1–2 tsp / 5–10 ml)\nTopping:\nSugar-free dark chocolate, melted (about 1 oz / 30 g)\n\nInstructions:\nIn a bowl, combine the Greek yogurt, peanut butter, cocoa powder, and sweetener until smooth.\nSpoon or shape the mixture into bonbons and place them on a parchment-lined tray.\nFreeze for at least 4 hours, until fully firm.\nDip the frozen bonbons into the melted sugar-free dark chocolate.\nReturn to the freezer or fridge until the chocolate sets, then enjoy! 🫶🏼\n. #chocolatebonbons', '{}', '{}', '', '', '', '[]', 0, 'Uploaded by user', '#7f5031', 'False', '', '🥜🍫 Peanut & Chocolate Bonbons – Creamy, Keto-Friendly & Freezer-Ready! By: @chiara.fiorani', 'False', '[\'#chocolatebonbons\']', '[]', '2befe97f414c70d302c25c354d94fd49', 'True', 'True', 'False', 'False', 'False', 'False', 'False', 0, '', 'photos', '', '', '', '{}', '', '', '', 'USD', 0, 'public', '', '', 'False', '', 247, '', 'Pin on Low Carb Dessert', 'False', '[]', 'False', 'True', '', '', '', '', 3161529839261985792, '', 'pin', '{}', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
